He further deposed that he is still working with him and getting salary of Rs.5,000/- to Rs.6,000/- per month; that petitioner had joined his office after 2  years or 03 years after the accident;
that he used to join office in the morning and they used to leave the office together in the evening.
He denied that salary certificate Ex.PW2/1 is a false and fabricated document or that the petitioner was not employed with him at a salary of Rs.20,000/- per month.
